Anyway,

590
00:24:30,519 --> 00:24:31,359
I haven't explained

591
00:24:31,359 --> 00:24:32,400
my transfer.

592
00:24:32,799 --> 00:24:34,279
I need to clarify it myself.

593
00:24:34,599 --> 00:24:35,319
Xu Anbo,

594
00:24:35,319 --> 00:24:36,400
record a video for me.

595
00:24:36,480 --> 00:24:37,440
I'll explain it myself.

596
00:24:37,519 --> 00:24:38,319
Okay.

597
00:24:38,720 --> 00:24:39,440
Wait.

598
00:24:40,279 --> 00:24:41,279
Clarifying now

599
00:24:41,440 --> 00:24:42,599
will only make things worse.

600
00:24:43,240 --> 00:24:44,160
What we should do

601
00:24:44,759 --> 00:24:45,839
is not to look at our phones,

602
00:24:45,839 --> 00:24:47,240
not to pay attention to those online opinions.

603
00:24:47,799 --> 00:24:48,519
Right.

604
00:24:48,839 --> 00:24:49,720
You said it yourself,

605
00:24:49,920 --> 00:24:50,599
the news hype

606
00:24:50,599 --> 00:24:52,000
will pass in a couple of days.

607
00:24:52,559 --> 00:24:53,359
Let's cut off the internet.

608
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:12,240
Seniors.

609
00:25:15,200 --> 00:25:16,000
What's up?

610
00:25:17,039 --> 00:25:18,279
Xie Yizhou sent a clarification

611
00:25:18,279 --> 00:25:19,440
to Gu Chenyang on Weibo,

612
00:25:19,640 --> 00:25:20,960
and the official Weibo of the sports school

613
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:21,759
reposted it.

614
00:25:21,759 --> 00:25:22,440
What?

615
00:25:23,440 --> 00:25:24,240
[Hello everyone.]

616
00:25:25,000 --> 00:25:26,319
[I'm here to clarify]

617
00:25:26,319 --> 00:25:27,319
[for my idol Gu Chenyang.]

618
00:25:27,880 --> 00:25:29,559
Yudong Middle School

619
00:25:29,559 --> 00:25:31,440
was recruiting players.

620
00:25:32,000 --> 00:25:33,680
I got a custom jersey,

621
00:25:33,799 --> 00:25:34,680
as shown below.

622
00:25:35,680 --> 00:25:37,039
We contacted Yudong

623
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:38,720
before the knockout round.

624
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:39,759
It has nothing to do

625
00:25:39,759 --> 00:25:41,000
with the recent incident.

626
00:25:41,599 --> 00:25:43,000
He hasn't left Yibei.

627
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:44,480
Don't be misled

628
00:25:44,480 --> 00:25:45,839
by those with ulterior motives.

629
00:25:46,440 --> 00:25:47,640
[The basketball thrower is No. 11.]

630
00:25:48,000 --> 00:25:48,599
Isn't this

631
00:25:48,599 --> 00:25:49,759
our first fan?

632
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:51,039
It's him!

633
00:25:51,920 --> 00:25:53,680
Last week, Xie Yizhou scored 30 points

634
00:25:54,160 --> 00:25:55,559
in the big win at the sports academy.

635
00:25:55,559 --> 00:25:56,599
He stole the show.

636
00:25:57,480 --> 00:25:58,000
I didn't expect

637
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:59,039
him to use the current hype

638
00:25:59,039 --> 00:25:59,960
to help us.

639
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:03,799
But the discipline of the sports school is very strict.

640
00:26:04,200 --> 00:26:05,720
Will he get into trouble

641
00:26:06,079 --> 00:26:07,160
for reposting on the official Weibo account?

642
00:26:07,480 --> 00:26:08,720
I just asked him.

643
00:26:09,079 --> 00:26:10,400
He told us not to worry.

644
00:26:10,440 --> 00:26:11,319
He has a plan.

645
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:12,279
Plan?

646
00:26:12,720 --> 00:26:13,599
What plan?

647
00:26:13,839 --> 00:26:14,599
I don't know.

648
00:26:16,519 --> 00:26:17,440
In that case,

649
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:19,400
we also have to pull ourselves together.

650
00:26:19,400 --> 00:26:21,000
We must find the person behind this.

651
00:26:21,720 --> 00:26:22,519
Right.

652
00:26:23,799 --> 00:26:25,640
Who has been leaking all this?

653
00:26:27,640 --> 00:26:28,440
Wait.

654
00:26:28,640 --> 00:26:29,519
I just remembered

655
00:26:29,519 --> 00:26:30,440
I have a photo of Gu Chenyang

656
00:26:30,440 --> 00:26:32,359
in his basketball jersey.

657
00:26:32,599 --> 00:26:33,559
Maybe if we take a closer look,

658
00:26:33,559 --> 00:26:34,720
we can find some clues.

659
00:26:34,799 --> 00:26:36,319
Then send it to the group quickly.

660
00:26:36,559 --> 00:26:37,400
I'm looking for it.

661
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:43,920
I found it.

662
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,720
Zhou Yang, wait.

663
00:26:55,880 --> 00:26:57,000
Guo Rui.

664
00:26:58,359 --> 00:26:59,160
It's him.

665
00:27:00,000 --> 00:27:01,400
We should have thought of it earlier.
